{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":3500,"height":170,"text":"# 数论与 RSA\n\n[[01_Math/07-Mathematics for Computer Science/02_数论与RSA|连续阅读：从整数相除到消息还原]] · [[01_Math/07-Mathematics for Computer Science/02_Structures#Session 12 — GCDs|课堂题与原始材料]]\n\n按 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 阅读；第 6 区复用已有证明工具。卡片标题打开精确共享原子，箭头说明具体关系。颜色只区分板块，不表示掌握度。"},
		{"id":"g1","type":"group","x":0,"y":260,"width":1000,"height":1260,"label":"1 · 整数关系与 gcd 构造","color":"4"},
		{"id":"g2","type":"group","x":0,"y":1670,"width":1000,"height":1000,"label":"2 · 素数与公倍数","color":"5"},
		{"id":"g3","type":"group","x":1250,"y":260,"width":1000,"height":1260,"label":"3 · 同余、求逆与解方程","color":"3"},
		{"id":"g4","type":"group","x":2500,"y":260,"width":1000,"height":1260,"label":"4 · 可逆余数的计数与指数","color":"6"},
		{"id":"g5","type":"group","x":2500,"y":1670,"width":1000,"height":1000,"label":"5 · RSA 的计算、正确性与边界","color":"2"},
		{"id":"g6","type":"group","x":1250,"y":1670,"width":1000,"height":1000,"label":"6 · 共享证明工具","color":"4"},
		{"id":"n001","type":"text","x":40,"y":340,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[整除]]\n*Divisibility*\n\nb = ak，其中 k 是整数。"},
		{"id":"n002","type":"text","x":560,"y":340,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[带余除法]]\n*Division with remainder*\n\n正除数 n：a = qn + r，0 ≤ r < n，商与余数唯一。"},
		{"id":"n003","type":"text","x":40,"y":660,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[最大公因数]]\n*Greatest common divisor*\n\n不全为零的两整数共有的最大正因子；gcd = 1 叫互素。"},
		{"id":"n004","type":"text","x":560,"y":660,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[欧几里得算法]]\n*Euclidean algorithm*\n\n(x,y) 换成 (y,余数)：gcd 不变，第二坐标严格下降。"},
		{"id":"n005","type":"text","x":40,"y":1000,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[Bézout等式]]\n*Bézout identity*\n\n存在整数 s,t，使 sa + tb = gcd(a,b)。"},
		{"id":"n006","type":"text","x":560,"y":1000,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[扩展欧几里得算法]]\n*Extended Euclidean algorithm*\n\n跟踪每个余数的原输入系数，最后返回 gcd 与 s,t。"},
		{"id":"n007","type":"text","x":40,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[素数]]\n*Prime number*\n\n大于 1，正因子只有 1 和自身。"},
		{"id":"n008","type":"text","x":560,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[素数整除乘积]]\n*Euclid's lemma*\n\n素数 p 整除 ab，就整除 a 或 b；用 Bézout 证明。"},
		{"id":"n009","type":"text","x":560,"y":2060,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[唯一素因数分解]]\n*Unique prime factorization*\n\n存在且素因子多重集合唯一；没有承诺快速分解算法。"},
		{"id":"n027","type":"text","x":40,"y":2060,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[最小公倍数]]\n*Least common multiple*\n\n两个正整数共有的最小正倍数。"},
		{"id":"n028","type":"text","x":40,"y":2380,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[公因公倍乘积]]\n*GCD–LCM product identity*\n\n两个正整数：gcd(a,b) lcm(a,b) = ab。"},
		{"id":"n010","type":"text","x":1290,"y":340,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[同余]]\n*Congruence*\n\nn > 1；a ≡ b (mod n)：n 整除 a−b，标准余数相同。"},
		{"id":"n011","type":"text","x":1810,"y":340,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[模运算]]\n*Modular arithmetic*\n\n同余类上加减乘；中间取余合法，改指数另需定理。"},
		{"id":"n012","type":"text","x":1290,"y":640,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[模逆元]]\n*Modular inverse*\n\n乘以 a 后同余于 1 的余数类；不是实数倒数。"},
		{"id":"n013","type":"text","x":1810,"y":640,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[模逆元存在条件]]\n*Inverse-existence criterion*\n\na 模 n 有逆元 ⇔ gcd(a,n) = 1。"},
		{"id":"n029","type":"text","x":1290,"y":940,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[线性同余方程]]\n*Linear congruence*\n\na,b,n 给定，寻找整数 x 使 ax ≡ b (mod n)。"},
		{"id":"n014","type":"text","x":1810,"y":940,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[同余消去律]]\n*Cancellation law*\n\n消去 c 时模数除以 gcd(c,n)；互素才普遍保留原模数。"},
		{"id":"n015","type":"text","x":1290,"y":1240,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[线性同余求解]]\n*Solvability and all solutions*\n\n可解 ⇔ d = gcd(a,n) 整除 b；可解时有 d 个模 n 解类。"},
		{"id":"n016","type":"text","x":1810,"y":1240,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[中国剩余定理]]\n*Chinese remainder theorem*\n\n两两互素模数：任意余数组合唯一对应模乘积的类。"},
		{"id":"n017","type":"text","x":2540,"y":340,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[欧拉函数]]\n*Euler's totient*\n\nφ(n) 计数与 n 互素的余数类；φ(1) = 1。"},
		{"id":"n024","type":"text","x":3060,"y":340,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[素数幂欧拉函数]]\n*Totient of a prime power*\n\np 为素数、k ≥ 1：φ(pᵏ) = pᵏ − pᵏ⁻¹。"},
		{"id":"n025","type":"text","x":2540,"y":640,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[欧拉函数互素乘法性]]\n*Coprime multiplicativity*\n\ngcd(a,b) = 1 时，φ(ab) = φ(a)φ(b)；CRT 配对可逆类。"},
		{"id":"n026","type":"text","x":3060,"y":640,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[欧拉函数乘积公式]]\n*Prime-factor product formula*\n\n从互异素因子计算 φ(n)；分解已知才直接代入。"},
		{"id":"n018","type":"text","x":2540,"y":1000,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[欧拉定理]]\n*Euler's theorem*\n\nn ≥ 2 且 gcd(a,n) = 1：a 的 φ(n) 次幂同余于 1。"},
		{"id":"n019","type":"text","x":3060,"y":1000,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[费马小定理]]\n*Fermat's little theorem*\n\np 为素数：非零余数 a 满足 aᵖ⁻¹ ≡ 1；所有 a 都有 aᵖ ≡ a。"},
		{"id":"n020","type":"text","x":2540,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[模重复平方法]]\n*Repeated squaring*\n\n按指数二进制位平方、相乘、取模；底数不必互素。"},
		{"id":"n021","type":"text","x":3060,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[RSA公钥加密]]\n*RSA public-key encryption*\n\n公开 (n,e)，保密 d；用配对的模幂编码与还原。"},
		{"id":"n022","type":"text","x":3060,"y":2060,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[RSA全消息正确性]]\n*All-message correctness*\n\n逐素数判零／用 Fermat，再由 CRT 合并；包括非互素消息。"},
		{"id":"n023","type":"text","x":3060,"y":2380,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[RSA安全边界]]\n*Security boundary*\n\n正确还原 ≠ 安全；分解假设、裸 RSA 结构与编码职责分开。"},
		{"id":"p026","type":"text","x":1290,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[不变量与部分正确性]]\n*Invariant and exit condition*\n\nEuclid 的 gcd 不变，退出时第二坐标为 0，故第一坐标为答案。"},
		{"id":"p025","type":"text","x":1810,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[秩函数与终止证明]]\n*Ranking and termination*\n\nEuclid 的余数、快速幂的指数都是严格下降的非负整数。"},
		{"id":"p017","type":"text","x":1290,"y":2060,"width":400,"height":180,"text":"## [[强数学归纳法]]\n*Strong induction*\n\n合数拆成两个严格更小因子，分别应用假设来证明分解存在。"}
	],
